<title>ISRAEL: Israel praises Deng as outstanding leader.</title>
<headline>Israel praises Deng as outstanding leader.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel expressed sorrow on the passing of China's paramount leader Deng Xiaoping on Wednesday and praised him as one of the most outstanding leaders of the century.</p>
<p>&quot;Prime Minister (Benjamin Netanyahu) sent condolences to the Chinese people and said that Deng Xiaoping was one of the outstanding leaders of the twentieth century,&quot; Netanyahu's spokesman said in a brief statement.</p>
<p>&quot;He led China into the modern era and contributed greatly to her ties with Western states,&quot; the statement said.</p>
</text>
